{
  "Name": "Nagios XI 5.6.0-5.7.3 - Mibs.php Authenticated Remote Code Exection",
  "Description": "This module exploits CVE-2020-5791, an OS command injection vulnerability in `admin/mibs.php` that enables an authenticated user with admin privileges to achieve remote code execution as either the `apache` user or the `www-data` user on NagiosXI version 5.6.0 to 5.7.3 inclusive (exact user depends on the version of NagiosXI installed as well as the OS its installed on). Valid credentials for a Nagios XI admin user are required. This module has been successfully tested against Nagios XI 5.7.3 running on CentOS 7.",
